### CRUD Endpoints Test Suite

### 1. User Profile Endpoints

### Get user profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/user-123
Content-Type: application/json

### Update user profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/user-123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "John Updated",
  "last_name": "Doe Updated",
  "bio": "Updated bio information"
}

### Update specific profile field
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/user-123/first_name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "Johnny"
}

### Delete profile image
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/user-123/profile-image

### 2. Restaurant Endpoints

### Get all restaurants (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants?limit=10&offset=0

### Get restaurant by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/restaurant-123

### Get popular restaurants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/popular?limit=5

### Get nearby restaurants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/nearby?lat=40.7128&lng=-74.0060&radius=5&limit=10

### Search restaurants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/search?query=pizza&limit=10

### Get restaurants by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/category/italian?limit=10

### Get restaurant menu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/restaurant-123/menu

### 3. Food Endpoints

### Get all foods (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/foods?limit=20&offset=0

### Get food by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/foods/food-123

### Get popular foods
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/foods/popular?limit=10

### Get recommended foods
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/foods/recommended?limit=10

### Get foods by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/foods/category/pizza?limit=15

### Get foods by restaurant
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/foods/restaurant/restaurant-123?limit=20

### Search foods
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/foods/search?query=burger&limit=15

### 4. Order Endpoints

### Create new order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "restaurant-123",
  "restaurantName": "Pizza Palace",
  "items": [
    {
      "foodId": "food-123",
      "name": "Margherita Pizza",
      "price": 15.99,
      "quantity": 2,
      "specialInstructions": "Extra cheese"
    }
  ],
  "subtotal": 31.98,
  "deliveryFee": 3.99,
  "tax": 2.88,
  "total": 38.85,
  "deliveryAddress": "123 Main St, New York, NY 10001",
  "paymentMethodId": "card-123",
  "notes": "Ring doorbell twice"
}

### Get user orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/user/user-123?limit=10&offset=0

### Get order by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/order-123

### Update order status
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/order-123/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "preparing",
  "deliveryPersonName": "John Driver",
  "deliveryPersonPhone": "+1234567890"
}

### Cancel order
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/order-123

### Track order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/order-123/track

### Test Error Cases

### Invalid user ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/

### Invalid restaurant search (missing query)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/search

### Invalid food search (missing query)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/foods/search

### Invalid nearby restaurants (missing coordinates)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/nearby

### Invalid order creation (missing required fields)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "",
  "items": []
}